00:55:35.560 --> 00:55:51.180
<v Ira Glass>Thanks as always to our program's co-founder, Torey Malatia. You know, I was just thinking about this the other day, how young he and I both were. We were so young when we made the deal to start the radio show, and we had that woman lawyer helping us, and we were both so strong-headed. I have a recording.
<v Ira Glass>一如既往感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚。你知道，我前几天还在想这个，我们俩当时有多年轻。我们开始制作电台节目时是多么年轻，我们有那位女律师帮助我们，我们俩都那么固执。我有一个录音。

00:55:51.180 --> 00:55:53.500
<v Elias>Fine. It starts on Saturday.
<v Elias>好的。从周六开始。

00:55:53.500 --> 00:55:57.100
<v Rachel>All right, good. But can you guys shake on it? I think this is--
<v Rachel>好的，很好。但你们能握手成交吗？我觉得这是——

00:55:57.100 --> 00:55:57.200
<v Theo>[SCREAMS]
<v Theo>[尖叫]

00:55:57.200 --> 00:55:58.290
<v Rachel>--interesting.
<v Rachel>——很有趣的。

00:55:58.290 --> 00:56:02.160
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。

